    demographics: 'A mix of tourists, expats, Thai residents, and monks. The Old City has a large transient tourist population, especially during peak season. There is a significant long-term expat community — mostly retirees, yoga/wellness practitioners, students, and people working in tourism and NGOs. Thai families who have lived in the area for generations also reside inside the walls. Very international and culturally mixed. More spiritual and wellness-oriented than Nimman.',
