      summary: 'Psyri is generally safe but has the issues you would expect from a nightlife district. On weekend nights, the area is crowded with people drinking, which can lead to occasional disturbances. Petty theft (pickpocketing, phone theft) is the most common issue — especially in crowded bars and on the street. Most people have no problems if they take normal precautions. The area is well-lit and busy, which helps. During the day, Psyri is much quieter and feels like a normal (if slightly gritty) neighborhood. At night, stick to well-lit main streets and be careful with your belongings and your drink.'
