      note: 'Internet in Psyri is adequate for most remote work. Some older buildings have older wiring. Speeds are generally fine but not always the fastest. There are several co-working spaces nearby and plenty of cafes with wifi. Many digital nomads work from cafes during the day when the area is quiet. Noise from nightlife can be a distraction if you work from home in the evening.',
